for i,t in enumerate(['Both tasks execute the same provider adapters.','ECR supplies the image; Secrets Manager supplies private keys.','CloudWatch collects task logs and a target-error alarm.','Terraform describes the infrastructure and scaling.','Origin hop uses HTTP in this draft; external APIs use HTTPS.','Diagram is a design, not proof of a completed AWS deployment.']):c.drawString(45,270-i*24,t)
