chapters=[('Purpose and implementation',concept[:2]),('User flow and interface',[p for p in slides[1][1]]+['The current implementation includes searchable cuisine suggestions, explicit loading and error messages, live restaurant detail retrieval, Berlin-local visit time input, a saved-ID list and separate privacy/terms routes. Keyboard focus styles and reduced-motion styling are included. These controls must still be exercised in an actual browser at mobile and desktop widths.']),('API and adapters',[html.escape((ROOT/'README.md').read_text().split('## API')[1].split('## Architecture')[0]).replace('\n','<br/>')]),('Data and estimation',[html.escape((ROOT/'README.md').read_text().split('## Experience and data')[1].split('## Structure')[0]).replace('\n','<br/>')]),('Cloud architecture',concept[2:5]),('Installation',[html.escape((ROOT/'README.md').read_text().split('## Run locally')[1].split('## Experience')[0]).replace('\n','<br/>')]),('Deployment procedure',['Read docs/DEPLOYMENT.md before creating resources. Install Terraform providers and validate the configuration, then review the bootstrap plan and calculate current regional costs. Obtain approval before applying.','Bootstrap creates infrastructure with deploy_app=false. Store both keys privately in Secrets Manager using the hidden-input script. Build an amd64 image and push it to ECR with an immutable tag. Review an application plan with deploy_app=true before applying it. Record the resulting CloudFront URL only after the service is stable.','The current IAM identity has authentication permission only. A deployment role needs scoped permissions for the configured services and restricted PassRole access. The user must approve that access. Runtime tasks receive only the execution permissions needed for logs, image retrieval and the two secrets.']),('Verification record',[html.escape((ROOT/'docs/VALIDATION.md').read_text()).replace('\n','<br/>')]),('Operations and limitations',['Monitor target 5xx errors, ECS task health and CloudWatch logs. The alarm has no notification destination yet. Do not log secrets or upstream response bodies. WAF rate limits reduce abuse but do not set a spending ceiling.','Rotate keys in Secrets Manager and restart tasks to load them. Roll back by selecting a previous immutable image tag. Review destruction plans deliberately; ECR images and recoverable secrets require careful cleanup. Protect Terraform state and migrate it to an encrypted remote backend for shared work.','Before public use: finish operator privacy details, configure provider quotas and costs, complete live tests and consider origin TLS. No uptime, load, latency or security certification has been measured.']),('Reflection and references',slides[8][1]+['Future research could collect appropriately licensed occupancy observations, define labels, compare a trained model to the transparent time baseline and evaluate calibration and error. This requires a defensible dataset; it cannot be replaced by invented crowd data.','References: Google Places API documentation and policies; FastAPI documentation; Docker documentation; HashiCorp Terraform documentation; AWS ECS/Fargate and App Runner availability documentation; Open-Meteo documentation; OpenAI Responses API documentation. Direct links are supplied in README.md.','This is a development draft, not a claim of completed deployment. Phase 1/2 and abstract drafts accompany it. The student must replace pending evidence and add genuine personal reflection and feedback before final submission.'])]
c=canvas.Canvas(str(OUT/'Phase-3-final-product-DRAFT.pdf'),pagesize=A4)
